E_FLAG_*`, alpha/gamma modes, `P_*` encodings, `PNG_CMAP_*`, sample-size and interlace-pass macros, `PNG_sRGB_FROM_LINEAR`, `PNG_DIV51`, `PNG_RGB_INDEX`, chunk-index/`png_file_has_chunk`) are defined locally in the module (I could not modify other files).\n- Declared the needed FFI locally: the read-only tables `png_sRGB_table`/`png_sRGB_base`/`png_sRGB_delta`, and stdio `fopen`/`fclose`/`strerror`/`__errno_location`.\n- The gray[16]-with-tRNS `break`-out-of-switch and the `png_image_read_colormap` common tail were carefully reproduced with explicit control flow to preserve exact behaviour.\n- A tiny `png_safe_error_shim` adapts `png_safe_error` (which returns `!`) to the `png_error_ptr` callback type.\n\n### Build status\nThe file compiles cleanly with **zero type errors and zero warnings of its own**. The only remaining build errors are `E0425 \"cannot find function\"` for cross-module symbols (`png_read_sig`, `png_handle_chunk`, `png_create_png_struct`, `png_muldiv`, `png_combine_row`, etc.) — these live in other modules that are still stubs (being written by parallel agents) and resolve via the prelude once those land. No externs were added for them, and no other files were touched.\n\nOne caveat worth flagging: many prelude modules (`png.rs`, `pngget.rs`, `pngrutil.rs`, `pngrtran.rs`, `pngset.rs`, `pngpread.rs`) are currently empty 2-line stubs, so a full link is not yet possible — this is expected given the parallel translation effort."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":272,"cache_read_input_tokens":264503,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":272,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_bdrk_01HZcMbAgyj5P4E2bXgyurtY","session_id":"a9e33088-46e8-41e9-a92d-60a8edf65823","uuid":"8dae9140-9faf-4d5a-8fd2-8abfde518784","timestamp":"2026-08-05T02:33:04.552Z","subagent_type":"general-purp